        "error_type": "冠词缺失",
        "fragment": "creating job",
        "explanation": "job 是可数名词，单数形式前需要加冠词。此处指代“创建任务”这一通用动作或特定实例，应使用 the job（特指该字段关联的任务）或 a job。在技术语境中，通常指代当前正在处理的那个 job，用 the 更自然。",
        "correction": "creating the job"
      }
    ],
    "rewrite": {
      "minimal": {
        "text": "Correct the trigger_by field set up logic when creating the job.",
        "explanation": "仅修正语法错误，添加冠词 'the'。"
      },
      "natural": {
        "text": "Fix the trigger_by setup logic when creating the job.",
        "explanation": "将 'Correct' 改为更常用的 'Fix'（修复），'set up' 作为形容词修饰 logic 时通常连写为 'setup'，更符合技术工单习惯。"
      }
    },
    "learnings": [
      {
        "title": "可数名词单数需加冠词",
        "rule": "英语中单数可数名词不能裸奔，必须加冠词（a/an/the）或限定词。在描述特定操作对象时，常用定冠词 the。",
        "instances": [
          {
            "wrong": "creating job",
            "right": "creating the job"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "wrong": "Please update the status of ticket.",
            "right": "Please update the status of the ticket."
          },
          {
            "wrong": "I need to restart server.",
            "right": "I need to restart the server."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Setup 作定语时的拼写",
        "rule": "当 'setup' 作为名词或形容词（如 setup script, setup logic）使用时，通常连写为一个词；而 'set up' 是动词短语。",
        "instances": [
          {
            "wrong": "set up logic",
            "right": "setup logic"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "wrong": "This is the set up process.",
            "right": "This is the setup process."
          },
          {
            "wrong": "We need to set up the environment.",
            "right": "We need to set up the environment."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
